# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Length 255 is one over the largest legal 254, so the ADU would be 261 bytes. Only the 7 header bytes are present:
# the framer must judge the header alone and not wait for the body.
00 01 00 00 00 FF 11
